---
// Opens with the thesis, not a features list. Also lays down the honesty
// beat immediately — a Gen Z audience clocks a fake "we win everything"
// sweep on sight, so we say so before the first competitor shows up.
---
<section class="hero mk-container">
  <p class="hero-eyebrow reveal">The comparison page, not the sweep</p>

  <h1 class="hero-title">
    <span class="reveal">Planners tell you</span>
    <span class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 60ms;"><em>when.</em></span>
    <span class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 120ms;">Flashcard apps tell you</span>
    <span class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 180ms;"><em>how.</em></span>
    <span class="hero-title-line reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 260ms;">Nobody tells you what's next.</span>
  </h1>

  <p class="hero-sub reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 340ms;">
    We looked at seven other apps students actually use. Below is what each one
    is genuinely good at, where it stops, and why we built the thing that sits
    in the gap.
  </p>

  <nav class="hero-index reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 400ms;" aria-label="On this page">
    <a href="#map">The map</a>
    <a href="#field">The field</a>
    <a href="#glance">At a glance</a>
    <a href="#honest">When not to pick us</a>
  </nav>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-block: clamp(56px, 10vw, 108px) clamp(48px, 8vw, 80px);
  }

  .hero-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--mk-font-mono);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mk-accent-ink);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .hero-title {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0 0.28ch;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5.4vw, 58px);
    max-width: 18ch;
    font-weight: 560;
  }

  .hero-title em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--mk-accent-ink);
  }

  .hero-title-line {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 6px;
    color: var(--mk-muted);
  }

  .hero-sub {
    margin-top: 28px;
    max-width: 54ch;
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.6vw, 18.5px);
    color: var(--mk-muted);
  }

  .hero-index {
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--mk-hairline);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px 24px;
  }

  .hero-index a {
    font-family: var(--mk-font-mono);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--mk-faint);
    transition: color 150ms;
  }

  .hero-index a:hover {
    color: var(--mk-ink);
  }

  .hero-index a::before {
    content: '→ ';
  }
</style>
